    "description_html": "<div class=\"content-intro\"><h3><strong>About Weyland Corp:</strong></h3>\n<p>Weyland Corp builds a benchtop protein assay platform for research labs. We&rsquo;ve raised &gt;$50M so far &amp; are growing the bench team.</p></div><div class=\"ql-block\" data-block-id=\"block-0001\">\n<p><strong>The role</strong></p>\n<p>You’ll own the sample prep stage of the assay, from&nbsp;raw lysate to a run-ready plate.<br>You will report to the Director of Assay Development.</p>\n<p><strong>What you’ll do</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Design and run prep protocols &amp; track yield across runs</li>\n<li>Work with automation on liquid handling and plate QC</li>\n<li>Write up methods the team can repeat&nbsp;</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>What you bring</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>PhD with 1+ years in industry, or MS with 5+ years</li>\n<li>Hands-on molecular biology &amp; biochemistry</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>The base pay range for this role is $111,725 &mdash; $161,950 per year.</p></div>",
    "classification_isco": {
      "id": "2113",
      "name": "Chemists"
    }
  },
